      "text": "BABYMONSTER 2nd MINI ALBUM [WE GO UP] POP-UP IN MANILA\n\nFinish all 3 stamps = 1 raffle entry! Win signed albums or exclusive pop-up goodies 🎁\n\nHow to Get Stamps:\n• 1 Stamp: Buy any merch\n• 1 Stamp: Post on social media using the official hashtag\n• 1 Stamp: Write a message on the Write-On Wall\n\nHow to Join:\n• Complete all 3 stamps on your Stamp Rally Card\n• Present your card to the staff\n• Fill out the online raffle form\n\n🗓 December 17, 2025 - February 15, 2026\n⏱ 11:00 AM - 11:00 PM\n📍Level 3, North Main Mall, SM Mall of Asia\n\n#BABYMONSTER #2ndMINIALBUM #WEGOUP #WEGOUP_POPUPSTORE\n#베이비몬스터 #MANILA #MallofAsia #WEGOUP_POPUPSTORE_PH",
